The Opportunity:

&nbsp;

We&rsquo;re looking for a Senior Product Designer to craft intuitive, scalable, and human-centered experiences across mobile, web, and wearable platforms. In this role, you&rsquo;ll own the end-to-end design process&amp;mdash;from research and concept development through launch&amp;mdash;translating insights into elegant, accessible interfaces that bring our product vision to life.

&nbsp;

You&rsquo;ll establish and evolve design systems that enable consistency and efficiency, partner closely with cross-functional teams to align usability with business goals, and champion design excellence across the organization. This role is ideal for a seasoned designer who thrives in collaboration, obsesses over detail and craft, and is passionate about creating technology that empowers healthier, more meaningful experiences.

&nbsp;

Applicants must include a portfolio of their work when applying.

&nbsp;

What you will do at VeSync:

&nbsp;

1. End-to-End Product Design

• Drive the design of user flows, interfaces, and interactions across app, wearable, and web platforms.

• Own the user experience design from discovery through launch.

• Translate user insights, research findings, and product strategy into intuitive, engaging, and scalable interfaces.

• Partner with Product Managers, Engineers, and Researchers to ensure design decisions balance value, usability, feasibility, and viability.

• Deliver design assets that reflect clarity, accessibility, and brand consistency.

• Rapidly prototype and iterate concepts using real user feedback and data.

&nbsp;

